   "source": "community",
   "text": "Welcome to Thelsamar, your home away from home in Loch Modan!\n\nThelsamar is a nice place, but it's not all beer and salted meat for those who answer the call to duty!  If you're willing to face danger in the name of the Alliance, then read the poster outside the Thelsamar branch of the Explorers' League.",
